{
  "revision": 2026111502,
  "character": "蕾叶的奶奶",
  "voices": [
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "そう、いい宿だよ〜。まだ寝てるヤツもいるし、 ギリギリまで温泉を楽しんでるヤツもいるし",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "4bcd6d85c0a013e3fd403efdeb6b091669a752e9798f11fbd9f618ca6e6e3a55",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_030.wav",
      "subtitle": "是啊，那家旅馆很不错～还有人还在睡懒觉，\n也有人抓紧最后一刻还在泡温泉",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "71cb19935408196f0b364fd968673a8a8ebc1ee6e31ea1b618b74d1571e40161",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "昔から泣く時は必ず１人になる。 カーテンの裏に隠れて、ちっこい背中を丸めて",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "f27baf6f931c055689abb322779aedffc99c657f54115e61ff70cc5191ed02c2",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_061.wav",
      "subtitle": "你从小一哭就肯定是自己一个人躲起来。\n躲在窗帘后面，蜷着小小的背",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "91e44b0246973f4736ba75200ba12c7fa54f69bf8e6ec1e3070b7f0ffeff8213",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "あれだけいいファミリーに出会えたんだ。 その寂しさを、ちゃんと分けっこできる人がいる",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "55b54f5140994c115006833c2156b2aed9407a2275afcbc8d03a8100cada26e9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_063.wav",
      "subtitle": "你能遇到这么棒的Family。\n有了可以和你一起分担这份难过的人",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "0cb4ed2685bdf74bf0d5ab96a170fd66c677cdeada4d99c2a2dec30ca8762e7c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『実は、鈴木が直接電話をよこしてきたんだよ。 ライブハウスの取引がしたいってさ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "752bef11ea66f1c23a0acd651175ab2488d6a849e4f95336ae7ae01a272ac55f",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_028.wav",
      "subtitle": "『其实，铃木直接给我打了电话。\n说想谈关于Live House的生意』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "35ed7fd1008d9915c70b1a6df3d694790507790ee40f0ba2d9e9073f2c14f0af",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『蕾叶からそう聞いてたから、その話は私からも断った。 蕾叶が決めたことを続けさせるのが親の務めだからな』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "51649b5b741cad89c9243499dc0a5eb3318af0d2d8d8bd4beb07f07f6f74a0a5",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_031.wav",
      "subtitle": "『我从蕾叶那儿听说了，所以我也拒绝了这件事。\n让蕾叶坚持自己决定的事，是家长的责任啊』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "8405a7556209079fc8dae247d7a7412480bb5ca898b06c2594247d0474a481e0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『今日は絶対テントで寝る！ って言うから 慌ててペグなしのテントを買ったんだからな？』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "afc86c5598dd59d44621f7e57f71505beaedc7b3ace974c779f9caec8a419fcf",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_045.wav",
      "subtitle": "『你那天死活要睡帐篷，搞得我们慌慌张张\n跑去买那种不用打地钉的帐篷，这你都忘了？』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "8f1a050fdc4c799cd810f0c022c6575f4c2afcd0472f6599192186999c2e246c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『ファミリーの先輩として……蕾叶の親として、 私は蕾叶が決めたことを全力で応援するよ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "3ba1585c81240063277ec0b5a47d2d15c42a02f9b7e82f7b30875e9483e78903",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_059.wav",
      "subtitle": "『作为Family的前辈……作为蕾叶的家长，\n我会全力支持你的决定』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "3896b42e8b4d4dc02a949e34ed7af42f9ac087f7d353f78c1a930427a85115b8",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "ファミリーを取り戻すためでも 人様のライブをブチ壊すなんてダメに決まってるだろ！！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "9dc541377efc7582e5fb1b8e35162f214d71d446e4b1a74ced6aaa56f58c12cc",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_027.wav",
      "subtitle": "就算是为了夺回Family，\n你也不能去把别人家的演出搅得一团糟啊！！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "05ccb6d3bae5a1a371ddf6d23918cc113ebc2dbbd7a1c291618e0765c5b0ecbd",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "おや、そっちにいるのが、蕾叶のファミリーだね。 蕾叶と仲良くしてくれてありがとうね〜",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "161ef23771f65d028c2930728ddabcfcb6f923ec7d74ea069ae7a9861b79c802",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_036.wav",
      "subtitle": "哎呀，你们几位就是蕾叶的Family吧。\n平时多谢你们照顾我们家蕾叶啦～",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "35ac3223fce411f26c65ca337bf81292940cc2a56a066557761942969f87129d",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "……まあ、鈴木さんも子ども相手に随分なことを してくれたようなので、痛み分けということで",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ec4cc029926faf275020df27af22a36fd001e8305859c4d86b56befa326e4b61",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_050.wav",
      "subtitle": "……不过呢，铃木小姐您对几个孩子也没少下狠手，\n就当我们扯平了吧",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "7997eeebc3744c4421e28f89911d5221286037c1547fa7a0dbf9990ddd7092e1",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "蕾叶には、あんたのファミリーとばーちゃんたちがついてる。 そのことは忘れちゃいけないよ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "9132c6b5ceb394b978475337a18e34690e6a2ddd632ec578845325b43451a5d9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_064.wav",
      "subtitle": "蕾叶，你身边有你的Family，也有我们这些奶奶。\n这件事你可不能忘了哦",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "5d8debd9497e0117352e18100f4ea245309203c95404fcccfed9a63d7f5083a8",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "じゃ、あんたはファミリーのとこに帰りな。 お見送りはここまでで充分だから",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2fc0886bbc32d060db59ae0f392ba24bfcb19a5aebed3514ce7e3bcaeb0e69a9",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_076.wav",
      "subtitle": "那，你回你的Family那边去吧。\n送到这里就可以了",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "a68805c3475e635e5f15c2a9122559aae277d1df3e23fb05fc58643ebe564cb7",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "いやあ、これだけいい笑顔が見られたから 次の旅も心置きなく行けそうだ",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "030bf30d85656204ad08f04cb15cc11e280213d0dc8e06cb149d0592b26636ff",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_026.wav",
      "subtitle": "哎呀，看到你们笑得这么开心，\n下一趟旅行我也能放心出发了",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "d2fed800c76e727c34d99691c0d181f4e3e034873c6fae28eb8fe3a4a6c41d28",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "積もる話は山ほどあるんだ。 みんな、ご飯にしよう！ 両ファミリー顔合わせだ！！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "0d378c98d4554b846c0a2fbff4adc0bf56b39cb6f0da1c3716b27447797ae9d2",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_041.wav",
      "subtitle": "大家都攒了一肚子话要说。\n那就开饭吧！两边的Family见个面！！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "005ec92a8d9b320c61a64affd8be7c2abdf8500e6ef3da98ab3d219429d2be50",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "――ということで、この話は終わりだ。 いくら連絡されたって譲らないからな",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "2a3231d8a50014e539fe7edfee5869098deaa2e7d07213670aa23ec9703d4e7c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_033.wav",
      "subtitle": "——所以，这事儿就翻篇了。\n不管你怎么联系我，我都不会让步的",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "02006a3dc3c0fbad1c1aad2406fcc8f3ceb2c90c28a8e0fdfb291a16e2909e7e",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『今まであんたのやりたいようにやらせてきたけど…… もう充分頑張ったよ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "ee13d9bc6eef2aa9d5b4c64253f6f05b00ee1e71628e5c0917bfa9c78811955e",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_063.wav",
      "subtitle": "『至今都让你按自己的想法去做了……\n你已经很努力了』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "bacc1f5d864824ec69f69b1d0daa74308508aebca32a546875cc6c2aded01abf",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10454",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "あれ、もっと羨ましがると思ったのに。 昔みたいに『私も行きたかった〜！』って",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454/adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "4903d5f170ff0e33213abeec0e6c59b497fc177c547b32349d3925ef1ebe34a5",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_anotherstory_10454_034.wav",
      "subtitle": "咦，我还以为你会更羡慕的。\n会像以前那样喊着『我也好想去啊～！』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "cba70874080df1092e8220f049ea5cb4e7ef38cb971472620a3e5c0b4199f94c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_anotherstory_10454/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text/adv_script_anotherstory_10454-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『ライブハウスのことは今は気にしなくていい。 ばーちゃんに任せとけ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "898d1b8d81f4ba6b0971c902809fac7c0eda463cf6c0699ba5f46e6c70fccb7c",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_051.wav",
      "subtitle": "『Live House的事现在不用担心。\n交给奶奶就好』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6977777f226052b3bc95220050e79b8db17952aeeb412fda5582cd29ba392067",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_057",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『……そこまで言えるようになるなんて、 いいファミリーに出会ったな、蕾叶』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_057.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "3f8a67041ba853406fc470dcba958cd5ebcc1b469700d785ae8dc01498da6d79",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_057.wav",
      "subtitle": "『……能说出这样的话，\n看来你遇到了很好的Family啊，蕾叶』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "64be27cd765c70d9b85ece64f6aed97eea58dc9b39fa200d3897b1f3ab91f66a",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_064",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『蕾叶は自分のファミリーのことに集中しな。 まだ解決してないんだろ？』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_064.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "907b8ebf6f53c4accdc31361f2d2a75508be92934592f18e7c579a3665da3bce",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_064.wav",
      "subtitle": "『蕾叶你就专心处理自己Family的事吧。\n还没完全解决对吧？』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "6916fc99a79b13823b87503a253f53f0e5de738e74e6305b030ef512e55ce72c",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_038",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "おっ、あんたが噂の心玖だね！！ 大人相手に怯むどころか、脅したんだって〜？",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_038.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a2c38660ceb11a7347497ecde509fd608f17fe4d06bea105a4d21839afe09442",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_038.wav",
      "subtitle": "哦，你就是传说中的心玖啊！！\n听说你面对大人非但没怂，反倒把人家给威胁了～？",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "031d117560728229932c3d1f51b0b1410982a9d4b78303869ecadf4c42a7a2c4",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_047",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『――『半分脅されたようなもんですよ』って 鈴木が愚痴をこぼしてたんだ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_047.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "1dd94c173379502a95a976b48436a6cc983ceeb6f40228b6cc487b7f5db98a5d",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_047.wav",
      "subtitle": "铃木那家伙跟我抱怨说\n『简直跟被威胁了一样』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "1264aa14496d986282a7c5243d63fdfee2c05808da450df07183e5f54a472cc5",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_046",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10099",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "孫への教育が行き届いておらず 大変ご迷惑をおかけいたしました",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_046.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a14c5446cf3a741f8c4e9f6eab22327e70450f2d668c431f0197b782de7b447e",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_20_046.wav",
      "subtitle": "是我对孙女的管教不周，\n给您添了这么大麻烦，非常抱歉",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "2f58fae24bea49c9bf9ff268aa693acad942e74bad01c8de7db3d76a5828ee45",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_20-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_018",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『お、蕾叶のファミリーも一緒か？ ちょっと私に顔を見せておくれ！』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_018.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "4e68b759629289a728e0d9e9cc5cb2d3917978a33744f977f6f7598bbd5315c5",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_018.wav",
      "subtitle": "『哦，蕾叶的Family也在一起吗？\n让我见见你们吧！』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "e1b0119feacbc47f423bc7781cdf00400a2b61d0d28ed818d70187b1c0e18970",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_023",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10096",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『あっはっは！ 聞いてた通り元気なファミリーでいいじゃないか！』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_023.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "c84fb21fa921e726eb5a8975fcf58c377696ccb98b59010824fd9977540d7633",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_17_023.wav",
      "subtitle": "『啊哈哈！\n跟听说的一样，是群有活力的Family，多好啊！』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "aed313cc240da159c9eaa805639f66afa9f586db044f97419d963321bed7f6e3",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_17-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_066",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『はーい、任されました！ いや〜、久々に日本に帰るのも楽しみだよ！』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_066.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "a23fe08b7332ed620fc94b3f65157ed573b69e9268fbe41e93497059ab7878f3",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_066.wav",
      "subtitle": "『好～包在我身上！\n哎呀～好久没回日本了，还真挺期待的！』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "a658a294162ff0e024328773b277c1323dc93bb70b52aa61398c39b7e3ed0381",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_042",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18",
      "speaker": "raikagrandmother",
      "text": "『え？ ああ…… 蕾叶がどうしても行くって大泣きしたからなあ』",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_042.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "d747ad4c185b793a11d7f28b01066cb441d0ac4c16685811432317d87b291c00",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_18_042.wav",
      "subtitle": "『啊？哦……\n那还不是因为蕾叶你大哭大闹说非要去露营嘛』",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "4e8fa66bb90f0ca44b96afe8cfb7884085aed19b45d348d163f92d65e0ef02b5",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_18-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_08_072",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_08",
